# ⊤ ⊑ X: a bodiless clause the root takes for every individual (E4).
# Expect: consistent; A ⊑ X.
@prefix :     <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .
:X a owl:Class . :Y a owl:Class . :A a owl:Class .
owl:Thing rdfs:subClassOf :X .
:X owl:disjointWith :Y .
:a a owl:NamedIndividual , :A .

